<blockquote class="uncited"><div>I did a little searching, and I can't seem to find anyone who has the same issue with the MD-9600. It seems that on each version of the firmware, the numeric keys on my mic seems to enter the incorrect numbers.<br><br>For example.... Press 4, 5 displays on screen. Press 5, 5 also displays. It is a bit odd.<br><br>Am I missing something, or potentially could this be a known issue?<br><br>Running the latest 7/2/2023 FW on the V1 HW.</div></blockquote>Sounds like a problem with the way the microphone buttons work.<br><br>Unfortunately the mic buttons use an analogue matrix consisting of resistors, so that there is a different voltage depending on which button is pressed.<br><br>Can you try cleaning and re-seating the mic connector.<br><br>BTW.<br><br>Does the mic work OK when using the official firmware.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Jul 06, 2023 6:01 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
